# a5530: the widgets in the home base's top bar (home-widgets): clock, now, pomodoro, notices
role widgets : between gap x3, align center
role widget : align center
role widget.wide : align center
role wclock : between gap
role wtime : text up 3 medium, ink
role wdate : text down, soft
role nowbar : between gap
role nowline : between gap, on wash, corner gap x2, pad gap /2, pad left gap x1.5, pad right gap x1.5
role nowlabel : text down 2 medium tracked, accent
role nowtext : text down, ink, width 22em
role pomo : between gap
