role pomochip : text down 2, soft, edge rim, corner gap x2, pad gap /4, pad left gap, pad right gap, touch
role nbar : between gap
role nbell : between gap, on glass, edge rim, corner gap x2, pad gap /2, pad left gap x1.5, pad right gap /2, width 34em
role nquiet : text down, soft
